{
  "title": "M07 GPU performance metrics: timer self-test, kernel sweeps 2^10..2^22 (bitonic global-only / fused / with transfers, ChaCha20 tags, AEAD open, bucket PRF), CPU baselines and the GPU/CPU crossover in the same session, pipeline stage breakdown and the real-time gate",
  "step": "S5",
  "seed": 7,
  "commands": [
